--- !u!114 &2035093380
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2035093378}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a52ac5dcc1036e7459c0f736b0dfb2f0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Hey! You must be the new recruit that I trained earlier, right? Pleasure to see
    you again!
  - "I hope you\u2019re ready to get down to business, because today we\u2019re going
    to infiltrate the system of an evil organization!"
  - "In order to do that, I\u2019m going to need you to help me get through a bunch
    of different areas with different obstacles in the way, using your knowledge
    of the file system to get past."
  - You should have already had a briefing on how to do things like creating and
    deleting files, but let somebody know if you need help with that.
  - "Well, with all of that out of the way, I think it\u2019s just about time that
    we get started! I\u2019ll go ahead and bring us into the first area now."
